From 0298fe0018398944307f3e5b59c1bcc64a7661d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "renovate[bot]" <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 15:29:53 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(deps): update module github.com/vultr/govultr/v3 to
 v3.33.0 (#19618)

* fix(deps): update module github.com/vultr/govultr/v3 to v3.33.0

* fix: guard against nil dereference in vultr service discovery

Signed-off-by: Jan Fajerski <jfajersk@redhat.com>

* fix(discovery/vultr): update mock content-type for govultr v3.33.0

govultr v3.33.0 only unmarshals response bodies when the Content-Type
header is exactly "application/json". The test mock returned
"application/json; charset=utf-8", so the instance list was never
unmarshaled and TestVultrSDRefresh failed. Align the mock with the
Content-Type returned by the real Vultr API.

Assisted-by: opencode (claude-opus-4-8)
Signed-off-by: Jan Fajerski <jfajersk@redhat.com>

---------

Signed-off-by: Jan Fajerski <jfajersk@redhat.com>
Co-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-authored-by: Jan Fajerski <jfajersk@redhat.com>
---
 discovery/vultr/mock_test.go | 2 +-
 discovery/vultr/vultr.go     | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/discovery/vultr/mock_test.go b/discovery/vultr/mock_test.go
index 03e5952..9a4405c 100644
--- a/discovery/vultr/mock_test.go
+++ b/discovery/vultr/mock_test.go
@@ -63 +63 @@ func (m *SDMock) HandleInstanceList() {
-		w.Header().Add("content-type", "application/json; charset=utf-8")
+		w.Header().Add("content-type", "application/json")
diff --git a/discovery/vultr/vultr.go b/discovery/vultr/vultr.go
index 56d8862..de8e22d 100644
--- a/discovery/vultr/vultr.go
+++ b/discovery/vultr/vultr.go
@@ -219 +219 @@ func (d *Discovery) listInstances(ctx context.Context) ([]govultr.Instance, erro
-		if meta.Links.Next == "" {
+		if meta == nil || meta.Links == nil || meta.Links.Next == "" {
